### Table 2 - VDOT vs training paces (full table, VDOT 30-85)
Table 2 maps each VDOT to the five Daniels training intensities. Columns: Easy/Long pace given per km and per mile; Marathon pace per mile; Threshold (T) given as time for 400 m, 1000 m and 1 mile; Interval (I) given as time for 400 m, 1000 m, 1200 m and 1 mile; Repetition (R) given as time for 200 m, 400 m and 800 m. Blank cells mean that value is not tabulated for that VDOT. Times under two minutes are printed as seconds (e.g. 98 = 1:38). The app should store these as durations and convert to pace.
